MyGo patch 0019: accept AppKit's generic file-drag operation.

A file drag whose source advertises only NSDragOperationGeneric was rejected
before the Rewrite panel saw its files. Treat that native effect as Copy, and
cover the panel's native drag path with a source mask of Generic alone.
